Your weapon attacks burn with righteous fury, dealing [55%, 68%, 78%, 87%, 95% (TL1-5)] of your lost HP as additional Fire damage (up to [248, 334, 401, 458, 508 (TL1-5; SP 100)], Current:  0).

Targets struck are also afflicted with a Martyrdom effect that causes them to take [8%, 13%, 17%, 19%, 22% (TL1-5)] of all damage they deal for 4 turns.

The bonus damage can only occur once per turn.
